The spectral angle treats each spectrum as a vector over its bands and
measures the angle between two such vectors, following Kruse et al. (1993):
\deqn{\alpha = \cos^{-1}\left(\frac{\sum_i a_i b_i}{\sqrt{\sum_i a_i^2}\,
